---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<!-- TODO: review before applying to AdSense. -->
<Layout title="Privacy policy | Baitaan" description="How Baitaan handles your data and which cookies it uses.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers baitaandessigns.com.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Data you enter</h2>
    <p>Our tools run in your browser. Numbers you type and files you choose are processed on your device and are not sent to our servers.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use these cookies on baitaandessigns.com:</p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead><tr class="text-muted"><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Cookie</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">What it does</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Lasts</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_theme</td><td>Remembers whether you chose the light or dark theme. Without it, we follow your device setting.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_consent</td><td>Stores your cookie choice.</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>These two are necessary for the site to remember your settings and are not used to identify you.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>With your consent, we use Google Analytics to understand visits and Google AdSense to show personalised ads. Google and its partners may then use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. Until you choose, Google's tags run in a restricted mode that does not store analytics or advertising cookies (Google Consent Mode). If you reject, you may still see non-personalised ads.</p>
    <p>You can change your choice at any time with the “Cookie settings” link at the bottom of every page. You can also opt out of personalised ads in <a class="text-link underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com">Google Ads Settings</a>. Learn more at <a class="text-link underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com</a>.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe to the newsletter at the bottom of the page, we store your email address, the date and the site you signed up on, only to tell you about new tools. We never share it. To unsubscribe or have your address deleted, use the <a class="text-link underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
    <p>hello@baitaandessigns.com</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
